{
 "v": 1,
 "name": "afk-v1",
 "about": "Tin Hat games v1.1 B10, away players at a Hold'em table (GAMES-V1.1-ADDENDUM §8.1), as scripted cases for the SERVER's table engine (games-s2 writes, games-design2 reviews). Seats are numbered 1..8 clockwise; players sit in the order listed (seat = index + 1). Steps: [\"deal\", by] = the host's Deal; [\"tick\", \"deadline\"] = the clock jumps to the current turn deadline and the timers run; [\"tick\", \"now\"] = the timers run at the current time; [\"tick\", \"pause\"] = the clock moves PAUSE_MS on (the next deal); [\"tick\", \"+N\"] = the clock moves N ms on; [\"act\", by, do, extra?] = a player's move (acting moves name the current hand + turn); [\"away\", by, on]; [\"gone\", [ids]] = the platform's set of seated ids with no socket on the table for GONE_MS (used at the next deal); [\"foldout\"] = whoever is to act folds until the hand ends; [\"react\", by] = a table reaction (F7; it never reaches the table engine: the runner does nothing, by design); [\"rig\", {seat: [c, c]}, board] = the open hand's hole cards and board (dealing order); [\"expect\", {...}] checks. Expect keys: away {seat: reason | null}; order [seats dealt in]; status; button; sb_seat; no_bet_from [ids] (no bet effect in the last step); deadline \"now\" | \"normal\" (the turn's deadline is the current time / current time + turn_s); last {seat, a}; seated [seats]; cashout {id, amount, reason} (in the last step's effects); winners [seats] of the first pot; state {seat: seat state in the public view}; hands_left {seat: n}. Every case starts with a fresh table, every player with the given chips; the deck is deterministic (randomInt = 0) unless rigged. Negative controls (they must FAIL the named case): AWAY_AFTER_TIMEOUTS = 2 fails one-timeout; dealing an away seat in (taking its blind) fails no-blind; treating away as folded fails timed-out-check-wins.",
 "constants": {
  "AWAY_AFTER_TIMEOUTS": 1,
  "AWAY_INSTANT_ACT": true,
  "GONE_MS": 20000,
  "AWAY_STAND_HANDS": 6,
  "AWAY_STAND_MS": 600000,
  "TURN_S": 30,
  "PAUSE_MS": 5000
 },
